    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "Two players use the same CP total in a force under Using Stratagems. Apply restrictions to the force as a unit. In any phase, each unit can receive only one of its stratagems. Insane Bravery stratagem use is limited to once a battle for the force. These limits govern all its stratagems.",
